{"seq":5,"slug":"idempotency-retry-compensation","title":"幂等、重试与补偿","stage":"DONE","category":"backend-engineering","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/idempotency-retry-compensation","rating":{"composite":3.54,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 幂等、重试与补偿 简介\n\n在分布式系统里，网络会丢包、服务会崩溃、消息会重复，「操作恰好执行一次」是一个无法靠投递保证的幻觉。本 hub 面向构建跨服务、跨系统业务流程的后端工程师，从投递语义（恰好一次的幻觉、至少一次与去重、API 幂等键）讲起，覆盖双写问题、Outbox 模式与事件驱动一致性，Saga 与补偿事务、编排与协同，以及支付幂等、可安全重试设计与一致性权衡。贯穿全篇的主线是：接受重复必然发生，用幂等消化重复、用 Outbox 保证不丢、用补偿实现可回退，并为每个场景选择恰到好处的一致性级别。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"delivery-semantics","title":"Delivery Semantics","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/idempotency-retry-compensation/delivery-semantics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"exactly-once-illusion","title":"恰好一次的幻觉","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/idempotency-retry-compensation/delivery-semantics/exactly-once-illusion"},{"seq":2,"slug":"at-least-once-and-dedup","title":"至少一次与去重","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/idempotency-retry-compensation/delivery-semantics/at-least-once-and-dedup"},{"seq":3,"slug":"idempotency-keys-in-apis","title":"API 中的幂等键","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/idempotency-retry-compensation/delivery-semantics/idempotency-keys-in-apis"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"distributed-consistency","title":"Distributed Consistency","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/idempotency-retry-compensation/distributed-consistency","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dual-write-problem","title":"双写问题","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/idempotency-retry-compensation/distributed-consistency/dual-write-problem"},{"seq":2,"slug":"outbox-pattern","title":"发件箱模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/idempotency-retry-compensation/distributed-consistency/outbox-pattern"},{"seq":3,"slug":"event-driven-co